lack on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fold-render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-render: add underline.rs (classifier, match key, host predicate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]word-snapped runs), plan underlines before continuations in one shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold plan, render runs, comments, image notes, and task links into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]host block, absorb underline IDs with link-aware Merged emphasis stubs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]heal standalone underlines, and rehearse the rollout on a scratch copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the affected notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scan counters, terminal bold, docs, and the Obsidian snippet[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fold-render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibility-docs: report merged and standalone underlines (with reasons) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in dry-run, scan, and JSON output; render quote emphasis as ANSI bold in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob ref show; document the feature; install and enable the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ref-highlights.css vault snippet.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Emphasis-aware quote preview in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-preview: a pure RefsCore excerpt that keeps late emphasis inside the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]4-line inspector preview, a plain-text quote tooltip, and bold runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of raw `**` in the Copy card picker.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9u","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9u.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitH